[{"title":"暮春随黄璞斋师游芙蓉山","author":"尤钧","text":"坐将芳草当文茵，检点年华又一春。\n绿野遍沾新雨色，青山可记旧时人。\n谢安未减登临兴，阮籍何须礼数亲。\n领取风光盈两袖，流莺花底剧翻新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山上巳","author":"尤钧","text":"看花载酒度芳辰，修褉欣逢天气新。\n山下管弦三月景，水边裙屐六朝人。\n野桃低亚常妨帽，芳草凄迷欲当裀。\n莫遣韶华容易去，夜游秉烛未嫌频。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"虞金铭","text":"遥夜不成寐，拥衾愁自生。\n更堪竹外雨，添作打窗声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄埠墩","author":"姚梦熊","text":"孤屿起中流，名传楚公子。\n一楼杨柳烟，四面芙蓉水。\n翠袖映雕阑，兰桡系香沚。\n入山佳景多，登眺从此始。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"听松庵","author":"姚梦熊","text":"庵在桃花坞，松深一径迂。\n夜涛浮石阁，秋影入僧厨。\n过客看图画，诗人访竹炉。\n百年凋零尽，山月冷烟芜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忍草庵","author":"姚梦熊","text":"白云封坞口，疏磬一声流。\n缘涧分松径，因山起石楼。\n风泉僧担冷，花院客筇幽。\n清景堪常住，浮生不自由。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其一 汉苑","author":"邹德臣","text":"人柳如人发上林，先于桃李旋生阴。\n冲牙乍拂千官佩，宝带新拖一缕金。\n似整欲斜欺燕力，乍眠还起有蚕心。\n柏梁宴罢春犹浅，分付枚皋作意吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其二 隋堤","author":"邹德臣","text":"剪彩才完绿尚柔，一丝丝解系龙舟。\n归帆百幅销金暗，殿脚三千翠黛羞。\n领袖烟花迷大业，唤回歌吹入扬州。\n而今寂寞寒鸦色，不到吹绵已自愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其三 军营","author":"邹德臣","text":"唤作条侯号颇宜，澹烟低锁戟门枝。\n难穿白羽稊犹小，乱拂红旗带已垂。\n画角晓吹金缕曲，铁衣寒映曲尘丝。\n将军令肃春难透，莫怪东王按辔迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其四 池上","author":"邹德臣","text":"慧晓池塘二月初，两株新绿似相于。\n不争春色和梅瘦，各抱柔情与水虚。\n风亸细腰疑拜手，雨飘纤缕忽联裾。\n相看青眼年俱少，莫问章台便索居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其五 灵和","author":"邹德臣","text":"当年忽忆张思曼，缕缕丝丝满露华。\n别殿风流移锦水，过江春色压莲花。\n萧疏只欲窥青琐，澹宕偏宜映碧纱。\n谁道一生无所诺，几回凤尾点黄麻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其六 板桥","author":"邹德臣","text":"人迹霜空逗晓烟，赤阑干外影娟娟。\n横分鸭绿温暾水，卧惹鹅黄细腻天。\n却听早莺乌鹊畔，爱梳新月彩虹前。\n玉颜去后无消息，一线牵愁十五年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其七 隔户","author":"邹德臣","text":"可是东邻眼乍窥，隔墙斜露小腰肢。\n轻丝剪剪初垂颏，薄晕重重未展眉。\n若许分明应看杀，转于依约惹相思。\n流莺飞过烦传语，愿结同心未嫁时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳八首 其八 武昌","author":"邹德臣","text":"检点春条一万行，武昌门外舞罗裳。\n风间运甓微微绿，雨外空滩冉冉黄。\n庾亮楼高分澹宕，吴蒙城近映微茫。\n食鱼休绾轻丝贯，留荫胡奴试马场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠马蓼庵六十","author":"张迎禊","text":"屈指升恒又十龄，芒鞋踏遍海山青。\n过墙浊酒朝朝漉，接舍高谈夜夜听。\n片月许分居士榻，一编拟注太元经。\n春风步屧南村柳，相唤相呼绿满汀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水龙吟","author":"张迎禊","text":"朝来静掩茅斋。\n喜无车马轻相过。\n匆匆朝市，年年奔走，应嗟计左。\n百岁光阴，人生能几，电光石火。\n问床头金尽，功名何物，休只是，悲无那。\n多少朱门烟锁。\n胜蜗庐，幸还未破，闲中且把。\n笔床茶灶，安排贴妥。\n待看春回，花明柳媚，莺吟燕和。\n更《南华》一卷，辋川半幅，尽饶清课。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"张列宿","text":"孤屿鸟声碎，风飘玉照堂。\n鹤闲多远梦，人静有余香。\n剩月孤云影，遥林残雪光。\n笛声吹又断，点入寿阳妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁鸿溪","author":"张列宿","text":"第一清流梁伯鸾，入吴高卧九龙滩。\n天低烟雨迷游舫，月淡蒹葭濯钓竿。\n四皓颂留磻石字，五噫歌挟碧云弹。\n只缘不肯因人热，溪水于今兀自寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过继梅小楼题画示陆子鸿仪","author":"张慥","text":"醉起呼童汲涧泉，小窗和墨写江天。\n青山有价争赊去，零落云霞护砚田。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题补庵先生菰川圃图","author":"张慥","text":"中书省里尚书郎，南郭曾开绿野堂。\n岩壑昔年称宰相，画图今日见羲皇。\n鱼渠鸟渡当人白，雉堞云生入暮苍。\n漫拟樽前挥彩笔，诸孙词翰亦飞扬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石门精舍","author":"张延祚","text":"凌晨多爽气，小驻依薜萝。\n白云补石罅，清风出岩阿。\n朝旭华远岫，残星逗遥波。\n露珠何的烁，草木争阿傩。\n凭栏供眺望，即景还摩挲。\n萧然拟出世，其如骨肉何。\n空谷无人来，当昼乃逾静。\n峰高绝鸟喧，露圆筛日影。\n余墨剩浅池，微香发古鼎。\n更衣翻短襦，盥手汲素绠。\n瞑目得奇观，漱津当香茗。\n习静垂湘帘，午钟发深省。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"守岁","author":"张泰开","text":"暮景光如驶，连宵绛烛然。\n自怜仍故我，却喜又新年。\n儿检通家帖，孙哗压岁钱。\n老夫无一事，枯坐半成眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁卯仲春秦味经少宗伯邀游玉泉山西湖即赋","author":"张泰开","text":"芳郊联袂快招携，草软沙明趁马蹄。\n社日乍开双燕幕，晴烟初放绿杨稊。\n千重山色排青障，百折泉流卷白霓。\n久说蓬莱今始到，銮舆常驻五云西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题云林洗桐图","author":"张步瀛","text":"先生爱洁本天真，坐对高梧洗涤频。\n眼见衰元多秽习，故将清品励时人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄埠墩三首 其一","author":"张步瀛","text":"九龙山下小金山，消夏蓉湖别有湾。\n无数画船红袖软，月明齐唱采莲还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄埠墩三首 其二","author":"张步瀛","text":"一楼山色一溪风，四面回廊八面通。\n输与老僧有清福，此身常住水晶宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄埠墩三首 其三","author":"张步瀛","text":"轻帆叶叶卸窗前，一片琉璃混水天。\n水面楼台天上月，凌虚一样十分圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡河作","author":"张步瀛","text":"官道征尘动，行囊健马驼。\n春风吹片席，晓日渡黄河。\n勋业筹长策，关山付浩歌。\n抚怀悲壮志，短剑一摩挲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自啸傲泾归家口占","author":"张步瀛","text":"渔浦晚收罾，遥村烟缕升。\n野风千顷稻，疏雨半湖菱。\n路转溪交树，桥欹石络藤。\n嵩山山下路，来往值枯僧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八月十五夜板桥玩月二首 其一","author":"章简","text":"矮屋抽身早，凭栏对月华。\n箫声翻子夜，柳色认丁家。\n径欲乘风去，高寒玉宇赊。\n沿街听瓦卜，吉语向人夸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八月十五夜板桥玩月二首 其二","author":"章简","text":"歌吹喧今夕，乘潮打桨频。\n独邀千里月，来唤六朝人。\n风露寒入许，江山迹已陈。\n板桥桥下水，呜咽总伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石门","author":"章简","text":"孤峭摩空碧，登临欲振襟。\n先天开一线，特地拔千寻。\n冷翠逼衣湿，飞泉带雨淋。\n仙踪何处觅，洞口白云深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由石门登三茅峰遇雨","author":"章简","text":"洞户何年闭，登临亦快哉。\n危崖当地出，急雨蔽天来。\n远景昏如雾，飞流响似雷。\n茅庵且小憩，前路滑苍苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己巳三月十四雨后知鱼槛玩月","author":"章简","text":"松顶响飞瀑，晚寒生画屏。\n屧痕黏藓碧，鬓影堕烟青。\n月碎鹤摇竹，雨香鱼闯萍。\n倚阑人不见，遥听玉珑玲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题寄畅园亭","author":"章简","text":"曲蹬拨云上，诸峰拱一亭。\n松声作竿籁，石气有仙灵。\n衣冷逼深翠，泉幽飞古青。\n便思凌绝顶，举手摘寒星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山塘即事四首 其一","author":"章简","text":"两行水柳碧于苔，双桨冲波画不开。\n鬓影如烟歌似雨，四条弦上送秋来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山塘即事四首 其二","author":"章简","text":"碧栏曲折绕修廊，石级登登到上方。\n自和风铃天半语，一枝颓塔挂斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山塘即事四首 其三","author":"章简","text":"一簇唐花护短坟，姓名片石尚嶙峋。\n情肠侠骨俱黄土，酹过真娘又五人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山塘即事四首 其四","author":"章简","text":"琵琶水面日闻歌，愁绝当筵唤奈何。\n莫怪吴儿心木石，青衫酒债近来多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其一","author":"章简","text":"乌篷小艇系垂杨，沙鸟随人到上方。\n门外驿尘阑外水，始知咫尺有炎凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其二","author":"章简","text":"凌波标格总珊珊，云水真宜洗眼看。\n绝忆莫愁湖上路，晓风吹浅碧阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32565,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其三","author":"章简","text":"闹红一霎雨声粗，水汽如烟黯镜湖。\n催得诗成偏受赏，绿盘擎出万明珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其四","author":"章简","text":"一棹拿音转水隈，卷帘岚翠泼新醅。\n自知不满闲鸥笑，特为看山触热来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32567,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其五","author":"章简","text":"石阑小憩纳凉飔，画遍琅玕自咏诗。\n只有孤禅知我意，朗吟先占最高枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32568,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其六","author":"章简","text":"飞泉树杪隔溪闻，洗出青天几片云。\n金碧楼台残照里，天然一幅李将军。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32569,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其七","author":"章简","text":"水楼一角绕城斜，波影罗罗绿上纱。\n落日齐开凉槅子，鬓丝风递素馨花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32570,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慈云寺观荷并游惠山纳凉八首 其八","author":"章简","text":"一眉新月烂于银，帘压无风不动尘。\n高处太寒人世热，不知何处著吟身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32571,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上巳前一日偕同人游惠山舟次口占","author":"章简","text":"绿波划破木兰舟，饯别东风作冶游。\n山好似诗工写意，春浓如酒不浇愁。\n良辰已届重三节，诸子兼居第一流。\n落拓青年成结习，醉乡花苑总句留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32572,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思补斋刻竹题诗","author":"章简","text":"恻恻轻寒护碧纱，香残酒冷送韶华。\n夕阳人散梨花院，细雨春归燕子家。\n湿翠半帘抽晚笋，暖烟一榻炙新茶。\n空阶绿绣苔钱涩，吟遍回阑手屡叉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32573,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张中丞庙","author":"赵继光","text":"阴森殿壁夹松楸，浩气还凭庙貌留。\n鼠雀已空臣力竭，江淮永奠阵云收。\n淋铃尚听深山雨，横笛偏催野戌秋。\n北望荒城寻故垒，只余睢水咽寒流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32574,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早春宿三茅峰二首 其一","author":"赵继光","text":"山水娱吾心，岂只涤尘俗。\n步出城西门，苍翠带华薄。\n西神迎解客，数片云生谷。\n穿云与泉窦，琤琮韵琴筑。\n隔涧樵歌闻，因之度山麓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32575,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早春宿三茅峰二首 其二","author":"赵继光","text":"幽琴唤山晓，林端尚微月。\n军持汲石泉，漱齿维摩室。\n推窗太湖翻，下瞰鼋鼍窟。\n泱漭春涛壮，云水互明灭。\n湖上七十峰，峰峰带残雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32576,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其一","author":"赵继光","text":"周家泰伯宋龟山，道德涵濡惠水间。\n一样文明称鼻祖，弦歌声里化荆蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32577,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其二","author":"赵继光","text":"右军宅作空王宅，眼底沧桑如是观。\n剩有多情永和月，夜深还照墨池寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32578,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其三","author":"赵继光","text":"望公坞上碧云堆，松吼苍崖石壁开。\n不向珠帘看飞瀑，笑人空到此山来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32579,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其四","author":"赵继光","text":"书香偏和麝香飘，往代豪华说旱桥。\n谁是樽前旧词客，满身凉月听吹箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32580,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其五","author":"赵继光","text":"浒溪溪口白云封，罨岸桃花水映红。\n柔橹呕哑小桥畔，几家同住武陵中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32581,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其六","author":"赵继光","text":"闾江北接胥山景，山麓灵胥庙貌存。\n牧竖不知千古恨，日斜吹笛过前村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32582,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁溪欸乃歌七首 其七","author":"赵继光","text":"青祁渰水水粘天，蟹簖渔罾每接连。\n买得浮庄平泛宅，绿蓑长染五湖天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32583,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒龟山先生祠","author":"周宜振","text":"载道南来识斗山，历阶从此溯曾颜。\n在悬钟鼓声常静，堆案诗书气自闲。\n风雨羹墙千载下，馨香俎豆二泉间。\n东林真伪何难辨，伊洛渊源第一关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32584,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扶竹","author":"周士俊","text":"满园风雪几枝眠，君本无心肯乞怜。\n高节岂因寒便改，清操应为励弥坚。\n谁教岁晚伤迟暮，惯历穷阴渐自然。\n松柏比邻时慰藉，莫嫌筇杖与扶颠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32585,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夹竹桃","author":"周金简","text":"春花偏上岁寒枝，新粉光凝灼灼姿。\n翠浪平翻桃叶渡，红云低压竹郎祠。\n无言自抱凌霄意，顾影生怜倚袖时。\n沉醉东风扶不定，碧窗敲彻玉参差。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32586,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"周金绅","text":"菱叶纤纤漾碧波，相逢不信十年过。\n曾经月夜听箫管，不卷珠帘拥翠螺。\n柳色分明堤畔路，桂香零落客中歌。\n沧桑有感君知否，一任鸣蛩唤奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江行杂感","author":"周金绅","text":"江边水落涨虚沙，望里迢遥去路赊。\n岸柳未青前度眼，山梅应白故园花。\n关津多阻如留客，魂梦频惊不到家。\n野鸟闲鸥飞不定，身随一叶寄天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送同年刘又韩给谏假归涿州二首 其一","author":"周照","text":"慈母前头拜问安，还家预卜举家欢。\n几人衣锦行当昼，莫怪乡邻羡又韩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送同年刘又韩给谏假归涿州二首 其二","author":"周照","text":"桑乾日夜水流东，古道黄尘夕照中。\n为问当年庐子干，尚余漆室倚楹风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鮕斋寓中白丁香盛开招同朱画庄王燮公龚思补顾晴沙陈絙桥分韵得阴字","author":"周照","text":"爱酒须共饮，爱诗须共吟。\n主人美遥夜，快饮吟春阴。\n取彼鲛人泪，溅作花深深。\n各自唾成珠，明月中升沉。\n吹花还度月，劝客当自斟。\n为君惜嘉树，明我有素心。\n素心不常聚，花落难重寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日登陶然亭次友人韵","author":"周日赞","text":"亭上游人笑语欢，又逢佳节倚栏杆。\n芦花旧雨曾相识，烟水今秋倍觉寒。\n作赋只应悲宋玉，带经悔不学儿宽。\n木兰坠露堪朝饮，收拾黄花佐夕餐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]